          "en": "Gains 20% [Rage] and [Shield Break]. ATK 5000% > 7000%. Ignores [Specialized Evasion] and [Non-Crit DMG Reduction] 45% > 60%. Inflicts [Energy Suppression] on 3 enemies > all enemies (marked for 3 turns). ——— [Shield Break]: during an attack, ignore the enemy's 30% DMG Free and Specialized DEF."
